    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Mary opened the book. \"This once held recipes I never learned to brew\u2026
    The Moonpetals have forgotten how to rest. These teas might remind them.\"\r\n\nLuna
    touched the pages. \"There's nothing here.\"\r\n\n\n"
