  m_Text: "Luna reached into her cap. She laid out her teapot, the candle, and the
    book Mary gave her. \r\n\n\u201CAll that\u2026 fits in there?\u201D the butterfly
    asked Luna.\r\n\n\u201C...oh. It\u2019s a tight fit,\u201D she said.\r\n"
